WEBVTT

00:17:28.329 --> 00:17:32.026
ko Ziemeļamerikas
Veksiloloģijas asociācija

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.449
atzinusi par Ziemeļamerikas
sliktāko pilsētas karogu.

00:17:36.179 --> 00:17:37.446
[Lepojamies ar Pokatello]

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.926
(Smiekli)

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.872
(Aplausi)

00:17:43.896 --> 00:17:45.047
Jā.

00:17:45.071 --> 00:17:46.301
(Aplausi)

00:17:46.322 --> 00:17:48.647
Uz tā pat ir reģistrētas
preču zīmes simbols!

00:17:48.677 --> 00:17:50.916
(Smiekli)

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.628
Skatīšanās uz to sagādā sāpes.

00:17:52.652 --> 00:17:53.802
(Smiekli)

00:17:53.915 --> 00:17:55.556
Paldies, ka uzklausījāt!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:18:01.942
(Aplausi)